  "description": "Ab4d.Assimp is a highly optimized cross-platform .NET Wrapper for the Open Asset Import (Assimp) library. Assimp library is able to import dozens of different 3D model formats (e.g. OBJ, FBX, GLTF, Collada). The wrapper library is using Span to access the native memory and this significantly reduces the required memory copy operations.",
